# Kind $4D's start (Kind4DStart, $83:CE7B) finding a copier's cartridge
# RAM: its check byte at $70:1000 + X reads back after its increment, so
# it fills $0000-$001F with $AA ($83:CE8A), which no retail cart does.
# The first level played as level1_walk.box; the copier RAM is turned on
# (cartram) 95 frames into the walk after the pause, just before the first
# kind $4D actor ($0C9B) starts. Turned on earlier, Aladdin is stopped at
# x $01A0 and never meets one.
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
hold RIGHT 120
press B
hold B+RIGHT 30
hold RIGHT 60
press A
wait 30
hold Y+RIGHT 90
hold B+R 60
hold DOWN 30
hold DOWN+A 20
hold UP 40
press START
wait 60
press START
hold RIGHT 95
cartram on
hold RIGHT 205
hold B+RIGHT 60
hold RIGHT 300
